# Server-side settings for the KaChat desktop container (docker-compose.yml passes these through
# from this file or the environment). All optional; nothing here is put into the browser bundle.
#
# The reverse proxy in front of the container, whose X-Forwarded-For the relay believes for its
# per-client rate limit (IPs or CIDRs, comma separated; default "loopback").
# KACHAT_TRUSTED_PROXIES=172.18.0.0/16
#
# Only on a PRIVATE install whose Nextcloud sits on the same LAN: let the relay reach private
# addresses. Never on a public deployment.
# KACHAT_RELAY_ALLOW_PRIVATE=1
